; Trailing: 0.2% of price behind the best price once the profit reaches 0.2%, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 2, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.32): 125 trades, PF 1.60.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026, at the backtest's costs (FTMO spread table, no commission): this setup 45 trades, PF 0.96, net -0.5R; the 4 setups of this combination together 181 trades, PF 1.31 (stressed 1.25).
; At VT Markets' costs (1.5-pip spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce) on the same months: this setup 45 trades, PF 0.94; the 4 setups together 181 trades, PF 1.24 (stressed 1.16).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: Jul-Dec 2024: this setup 37 trades, PF 0.70. The combination together: Jul-Dec 2024 PF 0.74 (137 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: FTMO XAUUSD M1 to May 15 2026, Dukascopy after; FTMO spread table; no commission in the test (VT: set CommissionPerLot).
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
